# Feeling Yachty Suite docs

`docs/feeling-yachty-suite.md` is the living how-it-works file for **feeling-yachty-suite** (the fleet plugin on FeelingYachty.com).

Whenever you change Suite behavior you must update that file in the same PR:

- Version / last-reviewed date
- REST `fy/v1` fields
- Shortcodes and `fy-auto` Woo product injection
- `fy-*` UI classes / data attributes
- Webhooks (`booking.paid`, `ticket.created`, `ticket.reply`)
- Admin “add a yacht” flow
- Changelog section at the bottom

Do not invent yacht names or prices. Quote Suite `pricing[]` rows.

Do not add a website chatbot, chat widget, or chatbot settings back into this repo unless the owner explicitly asks. Guest communication is GoHighLevel only (SMS, WhatsApp, email, calls).
